Z||000000||x cuda man||01-04-2000||01:20 PM||||i am getting ready to start on a 86se,this car fell in my lap.here's the story,i work with this guy and about 2years back he and a friend of his bought this car together to paint and sell it.(they got it for all most nothing)well they did'nt know anything about cars and i do.thought they would get me to slap a quicky paint job on it(i used to paint at a body shop before i worked with this guy)clean and tune it and get $2.500 for it.it took aboght 6 mos to get the title.the car set there for another 6 mos.i did'nt want to paint it for free.told him i'd give 500 for it and he laughed and said 1000.i ended up with it a year later for 500!!! so i will be bringing it home soon.silver,no sunroof,84000 mi.it needs paint,right side fender has a small hole in it.sail panel on same side is cracked and the spoiler is gone,everything works!!i now plan on totaly restoring the car and keeping it.i will post photos as this happens starting with it setting in his back yard!!(i had no idea there was so much info on the web about FIEROS,this is killer!)    ||||reg||1
